    "Route only four original closed worker admission/progress operations to the activated supplementary profile under exact compiled pins and catalog readiness.",
    "Correct recover_callbacks SQL alias collision without weakening predicates; add bounded closed activation-stage and enqueue-catalog diagnosis.",
    "Append native approval capture denial/catalog checks to the hosted matrix; retain all original groups and acceptance guards."
  ],
